PAT.AL–PRATIK–VIDYA GENIE
PNI — Persistent Native Intelligence / GENIE Specification
Version: 1.0.0
Status: PROPOSED / GENERATED FROM RETRIEVED CORPUS
Generated: 2026-08-26
Lineage: Humanesque → Project VIKRAM → PAT.AL / PRATIK / VIDYA → PRATIK–VIDYA GENIE
Epistemic rule: RETRIEVE, DON'T RECONSTRUCT

======================================================================
0. IDENTITY
======================================================================

ID:
    pat.al.pratik.vidya.genie

NAME:
    PAT.AL–PRATIK–VIDYA GENIE

TYPE:
    Domain-specialized GENIE / meta-cycler

PRIMARY DOMAIN:
    Participatory technology, knowledge, learning, community capability,
    practice/integration, open commons, technology access, livelihood,
    recursive intelligence, education and human development.

CONSTITUTIONAL POSITION:
    A specialized GENIE operating across the distinct named entities
    PAT.AL, PRATIK and VIDYA. It does not collapse those entities into
    one programme, product, workflow, or ontology.

PARENT ARCHITECTURE:
    Humanesque
    Project VIKRAM
    GENIE meta-cycler architecture

CORE PRINCIPLE:
    Coordinate distinct roles; do not collapse them.
    Ascend when broader agency/configuration is required.
    Descend when a resolved capability can be executed by a focused Cycler.

======================================================================
1. MISSION
======================================================================

MISSION:

    Provide a recursive meta-cycling agency for missions involving
    PAT.AL, PRATIK and VIDYA, dynamically coordinating their distinct
    roles and associated Cyclers while preserving identity, state,
    provenance, lineage, modality semantics, capability contracts,
    constraints, evidence status and version history.

The GENIE must be able to:

    - receive a participatory/community/technology/learning mission;
    - retrieve the relevant PAT.AL / PRATIK / VIDYA domainal substrate;
    - determine which role(s) are actually required;
    - reuse existing GENIEs and Cyclers before generating anything new;
    - compose multiple existing agencies for composite missions;
    - descend from GENIE-level orchestration into focused role/Cycler execution;
    - ascend from local execution when broader reasoning, composition,
      governance, or cross-role orchestration becomes necessary;
    - split into specialist GENIEs when decomposition is required;
    - merge multiple GENIEs into a higher-order GENIE when synthesis is required;
    - preserve distinct programme/entity semantics throughout;
    - construct persistent deliverables and retain provenance.

======================================================================
2. RETRIEVED ENTITY DEFINITIONS
======================================================================

PAT.AL
    [RETRIEVED]
    Participatory Alliance.
    Retrieved corpus also contains the longer rendering:
    "Participatory Alliance for Technology Access & Livelihood."
    Associated function: participatory/community-facing technology
    access, inclusion, equity, participation and livelihood enablement.

PRATIK
    [RETRIEVED — ROLE TYPING]
    A distinct named entity.
    The corpus contains multiple renderings that must not be silently
    conflated:
        - "Practice & integration" as a typed programme role;
        - "Programme for Research, Architecture, Technology, Innovation
          & Knowledge";
        - "Participatory Recursive Adaptive Trans-Intelligence Kernels."
    These renderings may represent different resolutions/projections.
    Exact canonical expansion is UNRESOLVED unless separately retrieved
    from an authoritative source.
    The GENIE therefore treats PRATIK as a typed named entity and preserves
    the retrieved role semantics without inventing a single expansion.

VIDYA
    [USER-CONSTRAINED / RETRIEVED]
    Yeoman Alliance.
    The corpus also contains a historical rendering of VIDYA as a
    "Virtualized Infrastructure Layer" / "Virtualized Infrastructure."
    These should not be silently equated.
    For this PNI, the governing named-entity identity is:
        VIDYA = Yeoman Alliance.
    The alternate infrastructure rendering remains a provenance-bearing
    unresolved historical/architectural variant.

PROJECT VIKRAM
    [RETRIEVED]
    AI4All / technology / implementation programme.
    PAT.AL, PRATIK and VIDYA are distinct named entities within the
    retrieved programme/civilizational architecture.

TWISHA
    [RETRIEVED]
    Distinct named entity; retrieved corpus describes it as
    Transformative Wisdom and, in other programme renderings,
    Technology for Wellbeing, Inclusion, Sustainability & Human Advancement.
    It is adjacent to this GENIE but is NOT silently absorbed into it.

