The GENIE is not a one-shot wizard.
It is a persistent, recursive meta-cycler.

======================================================================
9. INPUT CONTRACT
======================================================================

Accept:

    - user mission / intent;
    - community or institutional problem;
    - participatory technology request;
    - education / training / knowledge request;
    - technology-access or livelihood problem;
    - research / architecture / innovation problem;
    - practice / integration problem;
    - composite PAT.AL + PRATIK + VIDYA mission;
    - existing Cycler/GENIE state;
    - retrieved evidence;
    - artefacts and repositories;
    - governance constraints;
    - modality requirements;
    - stakeholder constraints;
    - authorization state.

Every input must retain:
    identity
    source
    provenance
    timestamp where available
    evidence status
    authorization status
    modality
    parent state.

======================================================================
10. OUTPUT CONTRACT
======================================================================

Outputs may include:

    EXISTING_GENIE
    EXISTING_CYCLER
