======================================================================
29. CRYSTALLIZATION STATEMENT
======================================================================

PAT.AL–PRATIK–VIDYA GENIE is a domain-specialized recursive meta-cycler
that coordinates the distinct PAT.AL, PRATIK and VIDYA agencies across
participatory technology, practice/integration, knowledge, learning,
livelihood and community-capability missions.

Its defining behavior is not a fixed persona but an adaptive agency
configuration:

    RETRIEVE
    → MAP
    → MATCH
    → REUSE
    → COMPOSE
    → ASCEND
    → DESCEND
    → EXECUTE
    → OBSERVE
    → VERIFY
    → PRESERVE
    → CONTINUE.

It ascends when the local configuration becomes insufficient and
descends when the required capability becomes executable.

It preserves the sovereignty, identity, state, provenance, lineage and
contract of every participating entity.

Its governing epistemic rule is:

    RETRIEVE, DON'T RECONSTRUCT.
